# AI-Based Employee Attrition Prediction and HR Analytics System

## Project Overview
This project uses Machine Learning to predict employee attrition risk and provide HR analytics through an interactive Streamlit web application.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Random Forest Classifier
- Streamlit
- Machine Learning

## Key Features
## Application Screenshot

![HR Dashboard](hr-dashboard.png)
- HR analytics dashboard
- Employee attrition risk prediction
- Model evaluation metrics
- Department-wise attrition analysis
- Overtime and attrition analysis
- Feature importance visualization

## Model Evaluation
- Accuracy: 81.97%
- Precision: 44.44%
- Recall: 51.06%
- F1 Score: 47.52%

*Evaluation results are based on the current test dataset and selected prediction threshold. Model estimates are not certainties.*

